    {
      "id": "S6",
      "text": "And because it remembers, it can prove. Every decision is written as code, not paper. The diagnosis. The treatment. The doctor's signature. Sealed with a hash. No one can quietly rewrite it. Anyone with the right to see it can verify it.",
      "from": 1278,
      "words": [
